<title>USA: Korea Telecom to issue $300 mln debt offering.</title>
<headline>Korea Telecom to issue $300 mln debt offering.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Telecom, the only licensed supplier of fixed-link, local telephone service in South Korea, is expected to soon tap the corporate bond new issue market, syndicate sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to be a $300 million offering underwritten by Salomon Brothers Inc.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>((-- Nancy Leinfuss, 212 859-1675))</p>
